# Internal bank data behind Cloudflare Access. These headers are a second
# layer, not the access control itself.
#
# There is deliberately no Content-Security-Policy here: the page pulls fonts
# from Google Fonts and Fontshare and reward artwork from the campaign's COS
# bucket, so a policy has to allowlist all three, and a wrong one fails
# silently in the browser. See "Optional hardening" in README.md for the header
# to add once you can verify it in a browser.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store

/api/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
